### Save transaction INCOME
POST {{URL}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

{
    "accountId" :1,
    "categoryId":1,
    "transactionType" : "INCOME",
    "amount":15000
}

### Save transaction EXPENSE
POST {{URL}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}
{
    "accountId" :1,
    "categoryId":1,
    "transactionType" : "EXPENSE",
    "amount":1000
}

### Ver todo (Página 0, de 10 en 10):
GET {{URL}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### Ver solo gastos de una cuenta específica:
GET {{URL}}/transactions?type=EXPENSE&accountId=2
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### Ver transacciones en un rango de fechas:
GET {{URL}}/transactions?categoryId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

